## Why This Is Asked
This asks for a concrete governance approach to align many teams around data contracts, versioning, and regulatory constraints, a frequent real-world pain point in fintech.

## Key Concepts
- Contract driven development
- Data contracts and API versioning
- Cross team governance and automation
- Compliance and incident response

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal contract validation skeleton
function validateContract(data, contract) {
  for (const field of contract.requiredFields) {
    if (data[field] === undefined) return false;
  }
  return true;
}
```

